\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Excitation energy of the first $2^+$ state in even-even nuclei as a function of the neutron number (top) and proton number (bottom), logarithmic scale. Grey points: all even-even nuclei; coloured lines: chains with a magic number of protons (top) or neutrons (bottom). Data: ENSDF, retrieved via the IAEA LiveChart of Nuclides (same data as NuDat).}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
